 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[140px] pb-[100px] max-w-[900px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Managed services</span><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[42px] md:text-[68px] leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[30px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Marketing, run as one system.<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Not five vendors pretending to talk to each other.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[18.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[620px] mb-10\">Strategy, content, production, campaigns and on-ground activation — handled by one team, under one plan, with one person accountable for all of it. We&#x27;re already running this for Gandhimathi Jewellers, JKR Tex and TNV Chits, and taking Rajaram&#x27;s and Nellai Kuttam Snacks into new markets.</p><a href=\"#contact\" class=\"inline-block bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[30px] py-[15px] rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_26px_rgba(245,166,35,0.24)] hover:brightness-105 transition\">Book a 20-min call</a></section><div class=\"border-y border-rule py-12 px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] flex items-center gap-11 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"neb-label  flex-shrink-0\">Working with</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-9 flex-wrap\"><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-faint\">Rajaram&#x27;s<span class=\"font-body text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase\"> · in progress</span></span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-faint\">Nellai Kuttam Snacks<span class=\"font-body text-[11px] tracking-[0.08em] uppercase\"> · in progress</span></span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-ink-2\">Gandhimathi Jewellers</span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-ink-2\">JKR Tex</span><span class=\"font-heading text-xl text-ink-2\">TNV Chits</span></div></div><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[110px]\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[34px] pt-[38px] pb-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-2xl mb-3.5\">One team, one point of contact</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Strategy, content, production, campaigns and on-ground activation — handled by one team, under one plan, with one person accountable for all of it. Not five vendors pretending to talk to each other.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[34px] pt-[38px] pb-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cpu text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M12 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M17 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M2 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 12h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 17h2\"></path><path d=\"M20 7h2\"></path><path d=\"M7 20v2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v2\"></path><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"8\" height=\"8\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-2xl mb-3.5\">AI-accelerated, not AI-only</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">A fast-moving team paired with AI-driven systems for content, scheduling and paid promotions — so organic content, ads and outreach run as one system, not three disconnected efforts.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[34px] pt-[38px] pb-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-2xl mb-3.5\">Built around how you sell</h3><p class=\"text-[15px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">No fragmented vendors. No guessing what’s working. Just marketing built around how your business actually sells.</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[62px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">What we do</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-4xl md:text-[48px] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em]\">One team across the <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">full execution layer.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-target text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"></circle><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Marketing Strategy</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Positioning, content strategy, campaign themes, audience and channel planning.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Social &amp; Content Systems</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Platform-specific content engine and consistent publishing across channels.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-camera text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.997 4a2 2 0 0 1 1.76 1.05l.486.9A2 2 0 0 0 18.003 7H20a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V9a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h1.997a2 2 0 0 0 1.759-1.048l.489-.904A2 2 0 0 1 10.004 4z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Content &amp; Photography</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Carousels, static creatives, short-form videos, explainers, copy and photography.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-film text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"18\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M3 7.5h4\"></path><path d=\"M3 12h18\"></path><path d=\"M3 16.5h4\"></path><path d=\"M17 3v18\"></path><path d=\"M17 7.5h4\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5h4\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Films &amp; Production</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Brand films, product and facility stories, leadership and culture videos.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-megaphone text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 6a13 13 0 0 0 8.4-2.8A1 1 0 0 1 21 4v12a1 1 0 0 1-1.6.8A13 13 0 0 0 11 14H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path><path d=\"M6 14a12 12 0 0 0 2.4 7.2 2 2 0 0 0 3.2-2.4A8 8 0 0 1 10 14\"></path><path d=\"M8 6v8\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Digital Campaigns</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Campaign creatives, landing-page content, lead-generation communication.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">BTL &amp; On-Ground Activation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">In-store activation, promoter-led events, dealer and distributor trade marketing.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-palette text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 22a1 1 0 0 1 0-20 10 9 0 0 1 10 9 5 5 0 0 1-5 5h-2.25a1.75 1.75 0 0 0-1.4 2.8l.3.4a1.75 1.75 0 0 1-1.4 2.8z\"></path><circle cx=\"13.5\" cy=\"6.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"17.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"6.5\" cy=\"12.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7.5\" r=\".5\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Brand Communication</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Visual direction, messaging, campaign concepts and communication assets.</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[30px] pb-8\"><span class=\"inline-flex w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-gold-wash items-center justify-center mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-column text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"M18 17V9\"></path><path d=\"M13 17V5\"></path><path d=\"M8 17v-3\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2.5\">Reporting &amp; Optimisation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Content performance, learnings and next-cycle recommendations.</p></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[660px] mb-[52px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">The engagement</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-4xl md:text-[48px] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">Eight things we run. <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">Three nobody else can.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">Market entry, BTL activation and distribution enablement need people on the ground. No software competitor offers them, because software cannot.</p></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-gold/25 hover:border-gold/50\" href=\"/services/market-entry\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-gold-text bg-gold-wash rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mb-3\">On the ground</span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Market entry</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Demand built in the months before launch, not scrambled after it.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-gold/25 hover:border-gold/50\" href=\"/services/btl-activation\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-gold-text bg-gold-wash rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mb-3\">On the ground</span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">BTL &amp; on-ground activation</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Sampling, in-store demos and outdoor branding, run every month.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-gold/25 hover:border-gold/50\" href=\"/services/distribution-enablement\"><span class=\"inline-block text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-gold-text bg-gold-wash rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 mb-3\">On the ground</span><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Distribution enablement</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Introductions into a distributor network — the conversation stays yours.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-rule hover:border-gold/30\" href=\"/services/performance-marketing\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Performance marketing</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Always-on Meta and Google, aimed at real catchments.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-rule hover:border-gold/30\" href=\"/services/influencer-marketing\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Influencer marketing</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Regional micro and nano creators, sourced and managed end to end.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-rule hover:border-gold/30\" href=\"/services/content-production\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Content &amp; production</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Photography, film, carousels and short-form, produced in-house.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-rule hover:border-gold/30\" href=\"/services/strategy\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Marketing strategy</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">Positioning, pillars and channel planning before anything gets made.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block rounded-[16px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 border transition-colors bg-surface border-rule hover:border-gold/30\" href=\"/services/reporting\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Reporting</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-5\">What worked, what did not, why, and what changes next month.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[680px] mb-[52px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">What we deliver</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-4xl md:text-[48px] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-5\">A month of work, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">counted out in advance.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[16px] leading-[1.68] text-muted\">No retainer that quietly shrinks. Here&#x27;s what a full-scope engagement looks like in a month — volumes are agreed up front and scoped to your market before anything is signed.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-px bg-gold/20 rounded-[16px] overflow-hidden mb-[52px]\"><div class=\"bg-gold px-6 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[44px] leading-none text-[#1A1208] mb-2.5\">60</div><div class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] leading-[1.4] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-[#1A1208]/70\">Image posts / month / platform</div></div><div class=\"bg-gold px-6 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[44px] leading-none text-[#1A1208] mb-2.5\">8</div><div class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] leading-[1.4] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-[#1A1208]/70\">Video reels / month / platform</div></div><div class=\"bg-gold px-6 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[44px] leading-none text-[#1A1208] mb-2.5\">10</div><div class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] leading-[1.4] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-[#1A1208]/70\">Influencer posts / month</div></div><div class=\"bg-gold px-6 py-8 text-center\"><div class=\"font-heading text-[44px] leading-none text-[#1A1208] mb-2.5\">10</div><div class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] leading-[1.4] uppercase tracking-[0.07em] text-[#1A1208]/70\">BTL activation days / month</div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-10\"><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] mb-1 pb-3.5 border-b border-gold/30\">Organic brand content</h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[620px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left\"><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Format</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Volume</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 align-top\">What it covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-rule align-top\"><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-gold-text\">Image posts</td><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">60 / month (2 / day)</td><td class=\"py-[18px] text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Product, category, offers and seasonal content across Instagram &amp; Facebook.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule align-top\"><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-gold-text\">Video reels</td><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">8 / month (2 / week)</td><td class=\"py-[18px] text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Short-form video — product use, demos, behind-the-brand — across Instagram, Facebook and YouTube Shorts.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] mb-1 pb-3.5 border-b border-gold/30\">Paid promotions</h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[620px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left\"><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Format</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Volume</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 align-top\">What it covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-rule align-top\"><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-gold-text\">Meta + Google Ads</td><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Always-on, all month</td><td class=\"py-[18px] text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Awareness, consideration and retargeting campaigns, geo-targeted to the markets that matter.</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-rule align-top\"><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-gold-text\">SEO</td><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">Continuous</td><td class=\"py-[18px] text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Keyword optimisation, quick-commerce listing optimisation, Google Business profile optimisation.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] mb-1 pb-3.5 border-b border-gold/30\">Influencer marketing</h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[620px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left\"><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Format</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Volume</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 align-top\">What it covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-rule align-top\"><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-gold-text\">Creator posts</td><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">10 / month</td><td class=\"py-[18px] text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Roughly 5 regional creators, 2 posts each — demos, use cases and reviews, published on their channel and amplified on yours.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[26px] mb-1 pb-3.5 border-b border-gold/30\">BTL activation</h3><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[620px] border-collapse\"><thead><tr class=\"text-left\"><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Format</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 pr-5 w-[22%] align-top\">Volume</th><th class=\"neb-label font-normal py-3.5 align-top\">What it covers</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-rule align-top\"><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-gold-text\">On-ground activation</td><td class=\"py-[18px] pr-5 text-[14.5px] text-ink-2\">10 days / month</td><td class=\"py-[18px] text-[14.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Sampling drives, retail activations, local events and hyperlocal promotional activity, rotating across priority neighbourhoods.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-faint mt-9 max-w-[680px]\">Media spend and creator fees are billed separately, at actuals — never marked up and never buried inside the retainer.</p><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 mt-[52px]\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[14px] border border-dashed border-rule-2 bg-surface-2/60 flex items-center justify-center p-6 \" style=\"aspect-ratio:3 / 2\" data-media-slot=\"btl-sampling\"><div class=\"max-w-[46ch] text-center\"><p class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-2.5\">photo<!-- --> · awaiting asset</p><p class=\"font-heading text-[17px] text-ink mb-2\">BTL — sampling drive</p><p class=\"font-body text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-muted mb-3\">A sampling table in a store aisle. Documentary realism, Indian tier-2 retail, natural light — not stock-photo gloss. Our most defensible service has no visual anywhere on the site.</p><p class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] text-faint\">Drop <code class=\"text-ink-2\">btl-sampling.jpg</code> into <code class=\"text-ink-2\">public/media/</code> · <!-- -->2400×1600</p></div></div><div class=\"relative rounded-[14px] border border-dashed border-rule-2 bg-surface-2/60 flex items-center justify-center p-6 \" style=\"aspect-ratio:3 / 2\" data-media-slot=\"btl-instore\"><div class=\"max-w-[46ch] text-center\"><p class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-2.5\">photo<!-- --> · awaiting asset</p><p class=\"font-heading text-[17px] text-ink mb-2\">BTL — in-store demo</p><p class=\"font-body text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-muted mb-3\">A promoter-led product demo in-store.</p><p class=\"font-body text-[11.5px] text-faint\">Drop <code class=\"text-ink-2\">btl-instore.jpg</code> into <code class=\"text-ink-2\">public/media/</code> · <!-- -->2400×1600</p></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[120px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[62px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[22px] block\">How we work</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-4xl md:text-[48px] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-4\">One system, five stages, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">one team accountable end to end.</span></h2></div><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-5\"><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl text-gold-text mb-3\">01</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2\">Strategy</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Business priorities, audiences, positioning, content pillars.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl text-gold-text mb-3\">02</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2\">Content</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Monthly content system, creative direction, copy.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl text-gold-text mb-3\">03</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2\">Production</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Shoot, edit, design — corporate, product &amp; facility assets.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl text-gold-text mb-3\">04</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2\">Distribution</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Social, campaigns, website, on-ground activation.</p></div><div class=\"border-t border-gold/30 pt-6\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl text-gold-text mb-3\">05</div><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-lg mb-2\">Optimise</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Performance review, learnings, next-cycle plan.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"relative px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[130px] pb-[140px] text-center border-t border-rule overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(50% 70% at 50% 100%, rgba(245,166,35,0.10) 0%, rgba(245,166,35,0) 62%)\"></div><div class=\"relative\"><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[36px] md:text-[56px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-6\">Tell us what you sell.<br/><span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">We&#x27;ll tell you what we&#x27;d do.</span></h2><p class=\"text-[17px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[480px] mx-auto mb-10\">Twenty minutes, no deck, no pitch. If we&#x27;re the wrong fit we&#x27;ll say so on the call and point you somewhere better.</p><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai?subject=Managed%20services%20%E2%80%94%20let&#x27;s%20talk\" class=\"inline-block bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[34px] py-4 rounded-full shadow-[0_6px_26px_rgba(245,166,35,0.24)] hover:brightness-105 transition\">Book a 20-min call</a></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px] gap-y-[40px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[11px]\"><span class=\"neb-label  mb-1\">Product</span><a href=\"/product\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Overview</a><a href=\"/product/gravity\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Gravity</a><a href=\"/product/pulsar\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Pulsar</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink trans